        "r": 567.1701000000005,
        "b": 531.8439999999999
      },
      "content": "If one of the measurements exceeds the programmed shut-down warning level, a message will appear on display (1) and general alarm LED (2) will light up, to warn the operator that the shut-down warning level is exceeded.",
