        "r": 559.7054999999996,
        "b": 360.36279999999994
      },
      "content": "A number of service operations are grouped (called Service Plans). Each Service Plan has a programmed time interval. If a time interval is exceeded, a message will appear on display (1) to warn the operator to carry out the service actions belonging to that Service Plan.",
