    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "txt_0231",
      "reading_order": 312,
      "section": "Automatic restart after voltage failure",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 91.65,
        "t": 318.5990999999999,
        "r": 558.189700000001,
        "b": 280.0220999999999
      },
      "content": "The regulator has a built-in function to automatically restart the compressor if the voltage is restored after voltage failure. For compressors leaving the factory, this function is made inactive. If desired, the function can be activated. Consult the Atlas Copco Customer Centre.",
      "section_id": "sec_auto_311",
      "parent_section_id": "sec_3",
      "section_level": 2,
      "section_path": [
        {
